      "cooked": "<ol>\n<li>\n<p>No.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Yes.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Not immediately, but when you need to do something.</p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<p>If it doesn’t specify which card, you pick.</p>",
