      "id": 140838,
      "name": "Ameena",
      "username": "Ameena",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/ameena/{size}/1907_2.png",
      "created_at": "2015-04-24T09:52:05.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Also, if asked to reveal cards from a deck and do different things with each of them when there aren't enough cards, you only do as much as you can, in order. As an example, if you're playing the Adept and use Arcane Cadence (which reveals five cards) when you only have three cards left in your deck, you'd reveal those three and do the first three things listed on Arcane Cadence (but culd choose which card each thing applied to - the reveal order doesn't matter, only what you need to do with them when your actions are limited by not having enough cards).</p>",
      "post_number": 7,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T04:17:49.137Z",
